[00:14.24]1. We live in the time of the harvest,
[00:19.82]A priv’lege beyond all compare.
[00:24.98]The wheat fields stand ready before us,
[00:29.68]And eagerly we have a share.
[00:34.74]With Jesus, our finest example,
[00:40.06]Directing our work in the field,
[00:45.26]How happy and honored we feel each day.
[00:50.66]We joyfully share in the yield.
[00:57.30]2. True love for our God and our neighbor
[00:59.68]Now moves us to speed up our pace.
[02:09.30]Both preaching and teaching are urgent,
[02:16.72]For shortly the end we will face.
[02:28.68]The joy we receive is a blessing,
[02:33.06]A gift that Jehovah provides.
[02:38.78]By faith we endure till this work is done
[02:43.98]And joyfully share at his side.
